{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3746480/extras/banner_en.png?t=1748277148\" /></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Dive into interstellar war</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">In Galactic Outlaws, you\u2019re part of an elite squadron tasked with impossible missions: sabotage, high-stakes rescues, and battles against enemy fleets. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Key Features:</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong><i>Embark on a thrilling space adventure! Conquer the first 5 challenging stages, defeat powerful enemy bosses, and choose from 3 unique ships with special abilities to complete your mission. Can you survive the cosmos?</i></strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3746480/extras/banner001dem_en.png?t=1748277148\" /></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Unlock and upgrade a fleet of ships, each with distinct weapons and attributes (speed, shields, firepower). Mix modules to suit your playstyle.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3746480/extras/Secuencia_01.gif?t=1748277148\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3746480/extras/banner002_en.png?t=1748277148\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Precision lasers, homing missiles, plasma cannons\u2014experiment to find your perfect combo!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3746480/extras/Secuencia_02.gif?t=1748277148\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3746480/extras/banner005_en.png?t=1748277148\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Face rival factions with adaptive AI and epic bosses that will test your skills.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3746480/extras/Secuencia_05.gif?t=1748277148\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Do you have what it takes to survive this galactic war?</strong></h2>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3746480?t=1748277148","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3746480/28026f4b84b6bfbbaebee7836fa5d2901051b0e1/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1748277148","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3746480/e29970c6976a0222b80ad49d49167bd098c6f354/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1748277148","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3746480/e29970c6976a0222b80ad49d49167bd098c6f354/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1748277148","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Game demo","id":10},{"description":"Full controller support","id":28}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"controller_support":"full","detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3746480/extras/banner_en.png?t=1748277148\" /></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Dive into interstellar war</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">In Galactic Outlaws, you\u2019re part of an elite squadron tasked with impossible missions: sabotage, high-stakes rescues, and battles against enemy flee